WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.150
Lab 1, in the kit's folder.

2
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:07.238
Step 1 runs the month and records
every run, with a lab change record.

3
00:00:07.238 --> 00:00:09.699
Ten run folders, ten records.

4
00:00:09.699 --> 00:00:12.778
Only signals and the metrics
pass their own checks;

5
00:00:12.778 --> 00:00:16.663
every other run found something,
as the earlier chapters showed.

6
00:00:16.663 --> 00:00:18.663
Step 2 reads the metrics.

7
00:00:18.663 --> 00:00:22.025
Protected coverage, sixty-four
point three percent.

8
00:00:22.025 --> 00:00:25.762
Two of eleven onboarded devices
have every rule in block.

9
00:00:25.762 --> 00:00:28.749
One of one enabled detection
has a passing test.

10
00:00:28.749 --> 00:00:31.462
Four of five synthetic
events did what they should.

11
00:00:31.462 --> 00:00:34.800
And mean time to triage
says not computed, and why.
